Derived material
----------------

The role prompts in pt_swarm/agent_definitions/ were written for this
port, but they describe and restate Antigravity's swarm worker, coordinator,
monitor, and narrator behavior. Treat them as derived from that design rather
than as wholly original text.

The subagent manifests in subagents/ and .polytoken/subagents/ condense the
same behavior for Polytoken's format.


