Before redistributing or promoting this project
----------------------------------------------

Confirm the upstream terms for the copied assets above, or replace them with
originals. The logo and dashboard are the likeliest to carry branding or
redistribution restrictions; the skill runbooks are the likeliest to be
redistributable with attribution. Deleting the copied assets and pointing
users at their own installation is a valid alternative if the terms are
unclear.
